commit a68c4625
author: biedongbin
date: 2026-10-22 17:04:05 -0600
subject: feat: claude-compat layer, model-context & statistics dashboard rework, ops tooling

Rebased onto upstream master (v0.5.75+) — replaces the previous conflicted squash.

- claude-compat layer: standalone dashboard page, settings write API
  (write-claude-settings), display_name rewrite (provider segment, verbatim
  rewritten id, [1m] suffix mirroring/stripping), default-model mapping,
  claudeEnv util + tests
- model-context dashboard: table view of per-model context facts with
  search/provider/status/override/connection/window filters, batch ops,
  per-model contextWindow overrides persisted via settingsRepo, inline
  editing with confirm/cancel
- statistics dashboard: usage stats page backed by requestStatsRepo
  (requestStats source), cascading provider/account/model filters with
  multi-select, auto granularity (>=30 points), multi-level breakdown table
  (provider->account->model / model->provider->account, dual tabs, merged
  cards, auto refresh, depth-tinted rows)
- gateway: retry same account 3x before fallback; keep modelStr
  re-assignable for claude-compat rewrite; capabilities applyContextOverrides
  on every resolution path + boot load in instrumentation
- providers dashboard: Claude Code minimal mode, grid filter toggles
  (hide disabled/unconfigured) persisted in localStorage
- opencode-go: deepseek family must not pass through the claude endpoint
  (tool declarations 400); free-tier models pinned to openai format
- tests: kiro external-idp endpoint-ordering aligned with the q-first
  strategy; golden buildHeaders snapshot committed (omitted upstream)
- ops tooling: isolated dev-test-server.sh (:20129) + smoke-test.mjs


